	quest.035CAEE848B6EAAF.quest_desc: [
		"&bMagnum Torch&r adds &athree kinds&r of &overy powerful&r Torches:"
		""
		"- &bDiamond&r: All monsters, such as zombies, skeletons, creepers, spiders, phantoms and so on."
		""
		"- &aEmerald&r: Passive mobs such as wandering traders and trader llamas (animals are technically affected, but not really, since they only spawn during world gen or from breeding, which are both unaffected by magnum torches)"
		""
		"- &dAmethyst&r: Cave and water mobs, such as bats, all squids, axolotls, and all fish"
		""
		"Only natural spawns will be prevented, so e.g. spawners and raids still work as they should."
	]
