	quest.19CE91B5B42C6066.quest_desc: [
		"The &bController&r allows players to &amanage&2 multiple storage blocks&r as if they were part of a &6single, unified storage multiblock."
		""
		"Storage blocks can be connected by &o&aplacing&r them &2directly adjacent&r to the &bController&r or next to &bother storage blocks&r already connected to the Controller. &3Connections&r can &oextend&r up to &615 blocks in any direction."
		""
		"&dRight-clicking&r the &bController&r with a &6stack of items&r in hand places that stack into one of the &2connected storage blocks&r if a &9matching stack&r already exists there"
		""
		"&dDouble right-clicking&r the &bController&r &6deposits all matching stacks&r from the &9player’s inventory&r into the &2connected storage blocks"
		""
		"&o&8This is alot to take in, refer to the wiki for more info"
	]
