	quest.4B21AF03C1396453.quest_desc: [
		"The &bStorage Tool&r performs various functions, including &alinking&r, &2locking&r, and &atoggling the visibility&r of storage block properties such as locks, counts, tiers, upgrades, and more."
		""
		"&n&7General Functionality:"
		""
		"The &bStorage Tool&r can operate on individual storage blocks or on all storage blocks connected to a &6Controller&r:"
