		"- &9Right-clicking&r a Controller applies the action to all connected storage blocks."
		""
		"&n&7Switching Modes:"
		""
		"    Use &9Sneak + Scroll Wheel&r to switch between the Storage Tool's modes."
		""
		"&o&8Check out the Sophisticated Storage Wiki for more info"
